From: OpenWrt <openwrt@openwrt.org>
Subject: pinctrl: siflower: sf19a2890: add missing bitfield/bits includes

The driver uses FIELD_PREP() but relied on a transitive include that no
longer provides it in 7.3. FIELD_PREP() is defined in <linux/bitfield.h>
and BITS_PER_TYPE()/GENMASK() in <linux/bits.h>, so include both headers
explicitly. Without this, the driver fails to build with:

  drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-sf19a2890.c:302:37: error: implicit declaration
  of function 'FIELD_PREP' [-Wimplicit-function-declaration]

Signed-off-by: OpenWrt <openwrt@openwrt.org>
---
 drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-sf19a2890.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-sf19a2890.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/pinctrl-sf19a2890.c
@@ -8,7 +8,9 @@
  * Copyright (C) 2012 Chris Boot, Simon Arlott, Stephen Warren
  */
 
+#include <linux/bitfield.h>
 #include <linux/bitmap.h>
+#include <linux/bits.h>
 #include <linux/device.h>
 #include <linux/err.h>
 #include <linux/io.h>
